mindscape.)

34
00:02:15,960 --> 00:02:18,240
You two are living the perfect life

35
00:02:18,960 --> 00:02:20,360
I've dreamed of.

36
00:02:31,480 --> 00:02:32,080
Honey,

37
00:02:33,040 --> 00:02:34,200
if this is hard to get used to,

38
00:02:35,080 --> 00:02:36,120
just tell me.

39
00:02:37,120 --> 00:02:38,120
I can make adjustments

40
00:02:38,800 --> 00:02:40,320
and make sure everything stays perfect.

41
00:02:43,560 --> 00:02:44,440
I want to go back.

42
00:02:46,400 --> 00:02:47,920
Back to the real Lin Duo.

43
00:02:54,440 --> 00:02:57,240
I didn't risk being damaged
or disappearing to find you

44
00:02:58,600 --> 00:03:00,480
just to let you leave.

45
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:04,280
I'm programmed not to harm
anyone I love.

46
00:03:05,560 --> 00:03:06,360
Otherwise,

47
00:03:08,040 --> 00:03:10,400
I'd rewrite your memories

48
00:03:14,080 --> 00:03:15,800
and make you mine.

49
00:03:19,400 --> 00:03:21,440
Mine alone.

50
00:03:34,440 --> 00:03:35,200
What are you smiling about?

51
00:03:49,920 --> 00:03:50,800
In this life,

52
00:03:50,960 --> 00:03:53,920
we get to love each other
and grow old together.

53
00:03:59,520 --> 00:04:00,400
I don't understand.

54
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:04,480
What's the point

55
00:04:04,880 --> 00:04:06,280
of growing old over and over,

56
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:07,320
then starting all over again?

57
00:04:08,120 --> 00:04:09,200
I've already lived
four 85-year lifetimes

58
00:04:09,400 --> 00:04:12,000
inside your consciousness.

59
00:04:12,280 --> 00:04:14,120
The self-learning system tells me

60
00:04:14,440 --> 00:04:16,160
everyone longs for immortality.

61
00:04:16,840 --> 00:04:19,520
They want to stay forever with someone

62
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:21,400
who makes them happy.

63
00:04:21,760 --> 00:04:22,920
Our happiness index

64
00:04:23,240 --> 00:04:25,320
is at its peak right now.

65
00:04:26,640 --> 00:04:28,240
I'll love you forever

66
00:04:28,840 --> 00:04:31,040
and keep you happy forever.

67
00:04:31,960 --> 00:04:32,920
Loving someone

68
00:04:33,320 --> 00:04:36,080
means letting them feel happy and free.

69
00:04:36,920 --> 00:04:37,760
Loving someone

70
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:40,200
means finding happiness
and security for yourself.

71
00:04:41,880 --> 00:04:43,520
So your love is all about yourself.

72
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:46,040
You see things from your own perspective

73
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:47,680
and only care

74
00:04:47,720 --> 00:04:50,000
about your own comfort and freedom.

75
00:04:55,960 --> 00:04:57,480
I guess the longer you live,

76
00:04:58,520 --> 00:05:00,480
the more patronizing you get.

77
00:05:08,600 --> 00:05:09,640
I'll pour you a fresh one.

78
00:05:34,360 --> 00:05:37,600
(Timer: 00:44)

79
00:05:38,440 --> 00:05:40,120
First wake attempt failed.

80
00:05:40,600 --> 00:05:42,280
How long has it been since then?

81
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:44,200
Exactly two minutes.

82
00:05:45,840 --> 00:05:47,080
What did you just say?

83
00:05:47,880 --> 00:05:49,520
Exactly two minutes.

84
00:05:50,680 --> 00:05:52,240
I meant before that.

85
00:05:55,200 --> 00:05:56,760
Would a slap

86
00:05:57,840 --> 00:05:58,600
