87
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:14,000
Still out.

88
00:06:14,520 --> 00:06:15,520
I can see that.

89
00:06:20,880 --> 00:06:21,880
First the physical approach,

90
00:06:22,720 --> 00:06:24,000
