105
00:07:45,720 --> 00:07:46,320
He's smiling!

106
00:07:51,560 --> 00:07:52,920
Why'd he stop smiling?

107
00:07:52,920 --> 00:07:53,480
Auntie,

108
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:55,360
