109
00:07:59,240 --> 00:08:00,440
It's getting to him emotionally.

110
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:24,800
Why?

111
00:08:39,120 --> 00:08:41,120
We're four minutes past the limit.

112
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:43,440
What do we do?

113
00:08:48,040 --> 00:08:50,320
I've never seen this happen before.

114
00:08:52,800 --> 00:08:54,520
Who wrote this book?

115
00:08:55,000 --> 00:08:56,360
Where did you get it, Auntie?

116
00:08:57,320 --> 00:08:58,040
(3C-091NB)
And this title...

117
00:08:58,400 --> 00:08:59,600
Why is it so weird?

118
00:09:09,200 --> 00:09:14,526
(11:52-12:00 PM)

119
00:09:23,360 --> 00:09:25,080
(Zhang Yongsen will come see you again.)

120
00:09:28,960 --> 00:09:30,200
(3C-091NB)
Take this with you

121
00:09:31,720 --> 00:09:33,160
(and bring him to me.)

122
00:09:41,120 --> 00:09:42,640
We're screwed.

123
00:09:49,040 --> 00:09:51,040
He's never getting out.

124
00:09:54,360 --> 00:09:56,480
She's impressive.

125
00:09:58,360 --> 00:09:59,760
She planned

126
00:10:01,160 --> 00:10:03,680
