169
00:14:00,720 --> 00:14:02,240
I want you to be happy forever.

170
00:14:03,360 --> 00:14:04,800
I don't know why.

171
00:14:06,400 --> 00:14:07,760
I know I love Lin Duo.

172
00:14:09,320 --> 00:14:10,160
And you're made up

173
00:14:11,400 --> 00:14:12,400
