174
00:14:12,400 --> 00:14:13,960
and my memories.

175
00:14:14,840 --> 00:14:16,600
You look like her
and have all her habits.

176
00:14:17,880 --> 00:14:18,920
But I just...

177
00:14:33,640 --> 00:14:34,400
You're not her.

178
00:15:29,560 --> 00:15:30,120
Buddy,

179
00:15:30,880 --> 00:15:33,000
I finally understand
what you said about my aunt.

180
00:15:34,520 --> 00:15:35,280
You were right.

181
00:15:50,360 --> 00:15:51,800
Gone

182
00:15:53,040 --> 00:15:53,920
at such a young age.

183
00:15:58,120 --> 00:15:59,760
I'd just started to make it
in my career,

184
00:16:01,840 --> 00:16:03,040
and now that's about to end too.

185
00:16:04,600 --> 00:16:05,360
Auntie,

186
00:16:06,680 --> 00:16:07,960
