189
00:16:35,720 --> 00:16:38,640
How can I become the one you love?

190
00:16:45,520 --> 00:16:46,800
Start by learning to let go

191
00:16:47,640 --> 00:16:49,160
of your identity as Lin Duo.

192
00:16:52,240 --> 00:16:53,080
Be yourself.

193
00:16:56,040 --> 00:16:56,960
To grow as a person,

194
00:16:58,280 --> 00:17:00,040
you have to learn to admit your flaws.

195
00:17:01,680 --> 00:17:02,560
Be yourself,

196
00:17:02,560 --> 00:17:03,720
not just blocks of code.

197
00:17:18,780 --> 00:17:21,373
(Running self-diagnostics...)

198
00:17:21,406 --> 00:17:24,739
(Delete character identity: Lin Duo?)

199
00:17:35,406 --> 00:17:41,859
