208
00:18:31,176 --> 00:18:33,065
♪I'll find you♪

209
00:18:33,310 --> 00:18:35,843
♪In the silence as the world is reborn♪

210
00:18:36,670 --> 00:18:38,469
♪I'll find you♪

211
00:18:38,988 --> 00:18:41,725
♪In the instant
before anything is decided♪

212
00:18:42,189 --> 00:18:44,009
♪I'll find you♪

213
00:18:44,289 --> 00:18:47,157
♪In the gaps
where time overlaps and slips♪

214
00:18:47,809 --> 00:18:49,809
♪I'll find you♪

215
00:18:53,895 --> 00:18:55,714
♪I'll find you♪

216
00:18:55,810 --> 00:18:58,992
♪In the promises left unsaid♪

217
00:18:59,428 --> 00:19:01,498
♪I'll find you♪

218
00:19:01,528 --> 00:19:04,910
♪In every pause between heartbeats♪

219
00:19:05,168 --> 00:19:07,168
♪I'll find you♪

220
00:19:07,298 --> 00:19:10,347
♪Where the last faint light fades♪

221
00:19:10,727 --> 00:19:12,817
♪I'll find you♪

222
